至光之家，門戸階陛左右，皆王僚之親戚也。夾立侍，皆持長鈹。酒既酣，公子光詳爲足疾，入窟室中，使專諸置匕首魚炙之腹中而進之。既至王前，專諸擘魚，因以匕首刺王僚，王僚立死。左右亦殺專諸，王人擾亂。公子光出其伏甲以攻王僚之徒，盡滅之，遂自立爲王，是爲闔閭。闔閭乃封專諸之子以爲上卿。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p007","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0075","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/086.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記·十二諸侯年表》原紀年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷014&oldid=2607001","quote":"十二公子光使專諸殺僚，自立。","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-014-r327-c15"},{"title":"《史記·十二諸侯年表》數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷014&oldid=2607001","quote":"515","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-014-r327-c00"}],"rationale":"按本篇具體事件與固定年表原格對讀；西元數字取數位編者附加對照，不是受傳文本原有紀年。未核書影或曆表，只到年，不換算月日。 專諸死亡屬同段四月丙子刺僚事件，年尺度暫與刺僚取同年；年表未另記專諸死亡。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"左右亦殺專諸","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷014&oldid=2607001","reference_event_quote":"十二公子光使專諸殺僚，自立。","reference_year_quote":"515"}}}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p009:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"諸","kind":"person","person_id":"78u_8ii_bnr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。","paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p009","chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note046:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"諸","kind":"person","person_id":"78u_8ii_bnr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。","paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note046","chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note046:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"專諸","kind":"person","person_id":"78u_8ii_bnr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。","paragraph_id